# Session working directories are run artefacts, not source. They also hold the
# verbatim transcript of whoever was interviewed, which is not something to
# publish by accident.
*
!.gitignore

# The exception: the priced option tables. Each one costs a full analysis run to
# produce and none of them ever changes, which is why prewarm.py writes them
# ahead of time. Without them a deployed interview prices on demand and the
# officer waits through it.
!_pricing/
_pricing/*
!_pricing/*.json
